(arrangements, I went home full of hope, although sadly impatient at the) Tj T*
(year's delay caused by all the mistakes and disasters.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Before getting there, however, I had an anxious time to pass through; it) Tj T*
(was necessary to provide some employment for the _Despatch_ and her) Tj T*
(consort the barque _Astoria_, and as no direct freight could be obtained) Tj T*
(for either I had to cast about for intermediate work for them. The) Tj T*
(sailing vessel I despatched to New York, and in an evil moment I made a) Tj T*
(contract, on the "no cure no pay" principle, for the _Despatch_ to tow a) Tj T*
(disabled steamer to the same port, arranging to go myself in the mail) Tj T*
(steamer so as to meet both ships there.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
