(New York I was disgusted to find both vessels in quarantine with yellow) Tj T*
(fever on board; also that the _Despatch_ had dropped her tow off) Tj T*
(Port-Royal in a gale of wind and come on without her.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This was a pretty mess for a youngster to be in, in a strange port like) Tj T*
(New York, where everything connected with Nassau was looked upon with) Tj T*
(suspicion, and the fear of yellow fever was rampant. It was my first) Tj T*
(intimate acquaintance with the disease, but, fortunately, the cooler) Tj T*
(climate in time worked its own cure, and, after encountering innumerable) Tj T*
(quarantine difficulties, both vessels were given pratique, but not) Tj T*
(before several deaths had occurred.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In the interim the _Despatch_ was seized for $30,000 at the suit of the) Tj T*
(owners of the steamer which she had attempted to tow, as damages for) Tj T*
(letting her go; and she was only released from quarantine to find) Tj T*
(herself in the clutches of the Marshal of the port. As I had no means) Tj T*
(for providing the required security, the captain and I formed rather a) Tj T*
(mad scheme to rescue her from his clutches. The captain was to get her) Tj T*
(under weigh quietly, taking the Marshal's officer with him, while I) Tj T*
(remained behind to lull suspicion. Early one misty morning he) Tj T*
(accomplished this successfully and began to steam slowly down the Bay,) Tj T*
(but the revenue cutter lying close alongside gave the alarm, and the) Tj T*
(forts opened fire at once. For a time he held on, and was nearly out of) Tj T*
(range when the pilot, fearing, I presume, for his share in the) Tj T*
(transaction, declined to go further, and there was nothing for it but) Tj T*
(ignominiously to return. Of course all this made my position worse, but,) Tj T*
(to make a long story short, a kind friend, a prominent New York banker,) Tj T*
