(out of Charleston or Wilmington instead of out of a neutral port, and) Tj T*
(nothing but superior speed and clever handling saved her from) Tj T*
(destruction within sight and sound of neutral territory.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The _Banshee_ having been earlier in the field was more fortunate, but) Tj T*
(the voyage was none the less exciting as she neared the Bahamas. The) Tj T*
(neighbouring seas were alive with cruisers who, regarding everything) Tj T*
