(      and scaled, and where the first flag of the invading army) Tj T*
(      was planted on the ramparts. The batteries at which the) Tj T*
(      first fierce hand-to-hand fights occurred were discussed as) Tj T*
(      the party walked over them, and General Curtis pointed out) Tj T*
(      about the spot inside the works where he fell, desperately and) Tj T*
(      almost fatally wounded by a piece of shell that struck him) Tj T*
(      over the left eye, and carried away a large piece of the frontal) Tj T*
(      bone and destroyed the eye. He was believed to be killed,) Tj T*
(      and when some of his soldiers were ordered to take him to the) Tj T*
