(      and foot-wear, and roll up pants and wade out. General) Tj T*
(      Curtis, who is a man of powerful frame and sound health,) Tj T*
(      soon stepped over the boat's side and into the water,) Tj T*
(      and as Colonel Lamb's health made him cautious about) Tj T*
