(      so Colonel Lamb rode the scribe to the shore. The newspaper) Tj T*
(      man then wanted to kick himself for not allowing) Tj T*
(      Colonel Lamb to ride his "friend the enemy," for he could) Tj T*
(      have witnessed the remarkable instance of a brave and) Tj T*
