(After this digression I must return to our movements on board the) Tj T*
(_Banshee_. Having obtained pratique \(for the quarantine was very strict\)) Tj T*
(and a local pilot, rendered necessary by the river being unbuoyed and) Tj T*
(strewn with torpedoes, we ran up at once to Wilmington. Here I found our) Tj T*
(agent Tom Power, who had an outward cargo ready for me, and the cheerful) Tj T*
(heartiness with which the slaves set about discharging our inward one) Tj T*
(was a pleasant surprise; if I hadn't been told they _were_ slaves I) Tj T*
(should never have discovered it. Everything had to be done at high) Tj T*
(pressure, for it was important to get out as quickly as possible, so as) Tj T*
(to try another run while the dark nights lasted, and loading went) Tj T*
(merrily on. I therefore did my best to win the goodwill of the) Tj T*
(officials, on whose favour I was of course in a great measure dependent) Tj T*
(for a rapid turn round.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Wilmington was already sadly pinched and war-worn. There never was too) Tj T*
(much to eat and drink there, and the commonest luxuries were almost) Tj T*
(things of the past; so when it became known that there was practically) Tj T*
(open house on board the _Banshee_ friends flocked to her. She soon) Tj T*
(attained great popularity, and it was really a sight when our luncheon) Tj T*
(bell rang to see guests, invited and uninvited, turn up from all) Tj T*
(quarters. We made them all welcome, and when our little cabin was filled) Tj T*
(we generally had an overflow meeting on deck.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(What a pleasure it was to see them eat and drink! Men who had been) Tj T*
(accustomed to live on corn-bread and bacon, and to drink nothing but) Tj T*
(water, appreciated our delicacies; our bottled beer, good brandy, and,) Tj T*
(on great occasions, our champagne, warmed their hearts towards us. The) Tj T*
(chief steward used to look at me appealingly, as a hint that our stores) Tj T*
(would never last out; in fact we were often on very short commons before) Tj T*
(we got back to Nassau. But we had our reward. If any special favour were) Tj T*
