(a landsman inconceivable. That men should be found willing to put to sea) Tj T*
(at all in these frail craft piled like hay waggons is extraordinary) Tj T*
(enough, but that they should do so in the face of a vigilant and active) Tj T*
(blockading force, and do it successfully, seems rather an invention of) Tj T*
(romance than a commonplace occurrence of our own time. True, running out) Tj T*
(was a much easier matter than running in, for the risks inseparable from) Tj T*
