(and ill-engined as she was, she so long escaped the numerous dangers to) Tj T*
(which she was exposed. I well remember, on our second run in, an) Tj T*
(accident which no one could have foreseen, and which came within an ace) Tj T*
(of ending her career.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(After a busy time discharging our cargo and getting coaled and loaded in) Tj T*
(order to save a trip before the moon grew too much, we made another) Tj T*
(start, and after a rough passage reached within striking distance of our) Tj T*
(port. It was a very dark but calm night; we had made out several) Tj T*
(blockaders and safely eluded them, when suddenly a tearing and rending) Tj T*
(of wood was heard, and splinters from our port paddle-box fell in all) Tj T*
