(the bearings and applying all the salad oil procurable mixed with) Tj T*
(gunpowder they were gradually got into working order again, all in the) Tj T*
(engine-room having assisted in the most energetic manner at this crucial) Tj T*
(moment.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The chase went on for fifteen weary hours?the longest hours I think I) Tj T*
(ever spent!?until nightfall, when we saw our friend, then only about) Tj T*
