(                              CHAPTER VIII) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                               OUR FLEET) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  First introduction to the _Will-o'-the-Wisp_?Making a dash for) Tj T*
(      it?A question of speed?Under heavy fire from both quarters?Run) Tj T*
(      ashore at full speed?An awkward predicament?All hands to the) Tj T*
(      pumps?Resort to desperate remedies?A struggle for sixty) Tj T*
(      hours?Sale of the _Will-o'-the-Wisp_?Her end?The _Wild Dayrell_?A) Tj T*
