(river to Wilmington.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Considering the appliances we had and the circumstances under which we) Tj T*
(were working, the saving of that steamer was certainly a wonderful) Tj T*
(performance, as we were under fire almost the whole time. The) Tj T*
(Northerners, irritated, no doubt, by their failure to destroy the ship,) Tj T*
