(all her bad luck and the amount spent upon her. Poor May, he was) Tj T*
(afterwards governor of Perth gaol, and is dead now,?a high-toned,) Tj T*
(sensitive gentleman, mightily proud of his ship, lame duck as she was.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(When she was burning, our utmost efforts were of course directed towards) Tj T*
(keeping her engine-room and boilers amidships intact, and confining the) Tj T*
(flames to both ends; in this we were successful, mainly owing to the) Tj T*
(fact of her having thwart-ship bunkers: but as regards the rest of the) Tj T*
(steamer she was a complete wreck; her sides were all corrugated with the) Tj T*
(heat, and her stern so twisted that her starboard quarter was some two) Tj T*
