() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(      I went over in the _Banshee_ and had an exciting time of) Tj T*
(      it; we arrived off the bar when Porter's vast fleet was there,) Tj T*
(      and I think the Confederate Trading Company ought to) Tj T*
