(I shall never forget that trip. We sailed from Nassau at dusk on the) Tj T*
(evening before Christmas day, but were only just outside the harbour) Tj T*
(when our steam pipe split and we had to return. As it was hopeless on) Tj T*
(account of the moon to make the attempt unless we could get away next) Tj T*
(day, I was in despair and thought it was all up with my 350 per cent) Tj T*
