(Yankee, who said: "Well _sir_, its only a question of price." I said) Tj T*
("Name yours," and he replied "Well I guess $400 for three clamps would) Tj T*
(be fair." I said "All right, if finished by six o'clock": he set to) Tj T*
(work, and we made all arrangements to start. Shortly after six the work) Tj T*
(was finished, but the black pilot then declared he couldn't take her out) Tj T*
(until the tide turned, there being no room to turn her in the harbour.) Tj T*
