(Christmas; send the bill in for the boats." Away we went clear, and) Tj T*
(fortunate it was we did so, as we only arrived off Wilmington just in) Tj T*
(time to run through Porter's fleet before daybreak.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The trip out was equally exciting, as I had as passengers General) Tj T*
(Randolph, ex-Secretary of State for War, who was going to Europe) Tj T*
