(convey some boiler tubes there. Being very anxious to reach Nassau) Tj T*
(quickly, I decided to go in her instead of waiting for the mail steamer) Tj T*
(which left a few days later.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(I made a start in the small craft \(her size can be imagined when I state) Tj T*
