(schooner, jeered at me from his bridge.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(When Wilmington was on the point of falling there was nothing for it but) Tj T*
(to transfer our operations to Galveston, and to accomplish this I took) Tj T*
(the _Banshee_ No. 2 over to Havana with a valuable cargo, accompanied by) Tj T*
