(cargo; the inward one was all right, and I found our assortment would) Tj T*
(sell well, but the trouble was to obtain cotton: there was extremely) Tj T*
(little of it left near the seaboard, and to get it from further up) Tj T*
(country was a long, tedious, and expensive process. Moreover, I found) Tj T*
(there would be great difficulty in having it pressed, and to take a) Tj T*
(cargo of half-pressed cotton meant very serious loss indeed; however,) Tj T*
