(It was an anxious time for the authorities, as it was expected that his) Tj T*
(battery would attempt a rescue, so the other two batteries were drawn up) Tj T*
(opposite with guns loaded ready to fire on it if it did. The sergeant) Tj T*
(was led out, and six men were placed a few paces in front of him; after) Tj T*
(refusing to have his eyes bandaged, he dropped his hand as a signal for) Tj T*
