(face dead. The saddest part of this incident was, that within an hour of) Tj T*
(his execution a pardon arrived from headquarters at Houston on a railway) Tj T*
(trolly; no locomotive being available four men had worked the trolly) Tj T*
(down, but too late.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
