(but no sooner did we get down to the Tripod, which marked the entrance) Tj T*
(to the channel, than we made out a couple of the blockaders?a sight) Tj T*
(quite enough for the nerves of our captain, who declared we should) Tj T*
(certainly be seen and immediately gave orders to turn back. This was not) Tj T*
